WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.091
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.091 --> 00:00:03.117
- [Narrator] Rising out of the forest

00:00:03.117 --> 00:00:06.167
in what was once a
wasteland is a masterpiece

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:09.687
that has taken
decades to build.

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:13.770
And the guy behind it says
he's not finished yet.

00:00:33.368 --> 00:00:34.669
- [Narrator] Peilun is
building this valley

00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:37.635
as a tribute to the ancient
civilization that once lived here.

00:00:37.635 --> 00:00:39.395
It covers nearly 50 acres,

00:00:39.395 --> 00:00:42.562
and most of it has been built by hand.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:53.778
- [Narrator] It was
thought that these masks

00:00:53.778 --> 00:00:56.082
had the power to help
people overcome hardships

00:00:56.082 --> 00:00:58.231
and ward off diseases.

00:00:58.231 --> 00:01:01.059
While Peilun decides the
design of every structure,

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:05.059
it's these locals who
really know the stonework.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.503
- [Narrator] This place wasn't built

00:01:25.503 --> 00:01:27.234
only with a tribute in mind.

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:30.092
An artist himself, Peilun
wanted others to be inspired

00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:32.925
by his work, and form a community.

00:01:55.021 --> 00:01:57.604
(upbeat music)

00:01:59.301 --> 00:02:02.218
(electronic music)

